                    Elevate Your Event Experience
                </h1>
                <p class="hero-subtitle" data-en="Premium DJ, MC, Photography & Uplighting Services in the DMV Area" data-es="Servicios Premium de DJ, MC, Fotografía e Iluminación en el Área DMV">
                    Premium DJ, MC, Photography & Uplighting Services in the DMV Area
                </p>
                <div class="hero-cta">
                    <a href="quote.html" class="btn btn-primary">📞 Get Your Free Quote</a>
